        <detaileddescription>
<sect1 id="classIMP_1_1multifit_1_1cluster_1_1AlignmentClustering_1autotoc_md0">
<title>bounding box enclosing both the particles of the native assembly</title></sect1>
<sect1 id="classIMP_1_1multifit_1_1cluster_1_1AlignmentClustering_1autotoc_md1">
<title>and the particles of the model</title><para>bb_union = IMP.algebra.get_union(bb_native, bb_solution) </para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classIMP_1_1multifit_1_1cluster_1_1AlignmentClustering_1autotoc_md2">
<title>add border of 4 voxels</title><para>border = 4*voxel_size bottom = bb_union.get_corner(0) bottom += IMP.algebra.Vector3D(-border, -border, -border) top = bb_union.get_corner(1) top += IMP.algebra.Vector3D(border, border, border) bb_union = IMP.algebra.BoundingBox3D(bottom, top) </para>
</sect1>
