    <briefdescription>
<para>Clusters assembly models. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The solutions are chosen by sorting the database according to the parameter orderby</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The models are aligned and clustered by RMSD</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
